---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="页面没有找到"
	description="你访问的页面不存在、已经移动或链接地址有误。"
	noindex={true}
>
	<main class="not-found">
		<p class="error-code">404</p>
		<h1>这个页面没有找到</h1>
		<p>它可能已经移动、改名，或者链接地址有误。你可以返回首页，也可以从文章目录继续查找。</p>
		<div>
			<a class="primary" href="/">返回首页</a>
			<a href="/posts/">浏览全部文章</a>
		</div>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.not-found {
		display: grid;
		place-content: center;
		min-height: calc(100vh - 250px);
		padding: 80px 22px;
		background:
			radial-gradient(circle at 70% 20%, rgba(70, 217, 197, 0.14), transparent 30%),
			#07152b;
		color: white;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.error-code {
		margin: 0;
		color: #46d9c5;
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 900;
		letter-spacing: 0.3em;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 16px 0;
		font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 78px);
		letter-spacing: -0.05em;
	}

	.not-found > p:not(.error-code) {
		max-width: 620px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.66);
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.not-found div {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 24px;
		margin-top: 32px;
	}

	.not-found a {
		padding: 13px 18px;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
		font-weight: 800;
		text-underline-offset: 4px;
	}

	.not-found .primary {
		border-radius: 10px;
		background: #46d9c5;
		color: #07152b;
		text-decoration: none;
	}
</style>
